    "bodyText": "Skip to Main Content\nCall us! 888-888-8512\n\nHow It Works\n\nCredits & Rebates\n\nContact\n\nServices\n\nYou either have a price, or you’re looking for prices. We developed a system in which both sides of the coin can win: You tell us your price, and within reason, we beat it. Sounds crazy, but it makes sense for us. We offer the lowest prices because we’re confident you'll tell many people you know about us and your experience. So, in addition to being the most affordable, we also provide you with the greatest service. It’s a simple strategy that’s never been executed because service providers are notorious for trying to squeeze the most money they can out of every customer, not realizing that once you figure out how much you overpaid, you’re never calling back. Not here. Our mission is for you to feel pleased and content so you tell all your friends. That is the way we grow. And that is how you have money for that family trip to Italy. \n\n \n\nSo, tell us what your budget is, and we’ll get started.\n\n \n\n                        Love,\n\n​\n\n                        Price Beat ❤️\n\nHow It Works\nBeat a Price!\nServing North Jersey & NYC for 30 Years\nCall Now\nBeat my Quote\nGet a Fast Price Review\nRedeem Your $150\n\nNeed a complete unit replacement? You're eligible to get $150 back as either a discount on your equipment and installation, or loaded onto a prepaid Visa, MasterCard, or American Express debit gift card.\n\nLet us know which you prefer\nContact Us\nContact\n888-888-8512\nhatemyacguy@lovepricebeat.com\nHours\nPM Eastern\ndays a week\nAM through\n7\n7\n7\nService Areas\nNew Jersey\nNew York\nMetro Area\nNYC\nLocation\nSend us a message\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone*\nMessage*\nSubmit\n\nLicensed & Insured HVAC Contractor\n\nPrimary Service Area: Northern NJ & NYC\n\nResponse Time: We respond as fast as possible — often same day\n\nPrice Beat HVAC\nLicensed & Insured\nServing Northern NJ and NYC for 30 years\n\nCall: 888-888-8512\n\n© 2026 Price Beat HVAC",
